  "aiContextParagraph": "The 2026 Copa Sudamericana final took place at the Estadio Metropolitano Roberto Melendez in Barranquilla, Colombia, featuring Atletico-MG and Boca Juniors. Boca Juniors secured a 2-0 win with goals scored by Ascacibar and Merentiel, marking the club's third title in the competition. This result reinforces Boca Juniors' historical performance in finals against Brazilian clubs. Following the match, Atletico-MG players expressed visible disappointment, and the outcome has implications for the club's 2026 season, as the defeat means the team will not receive a direct qualification berth for the Copa Libertadores. Media coverage noted that the match broadcast helped the channel SBT gain television viewership traction in the Greater Sao Paulo region. This event marks the second consecutive year that Atletico-MG has finished as the runner-up in the tournament.",
